  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这硬盘根本没坏  (These Hard Drives Are Not Broken)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Summoning the two Unit Two staffers out to the courtyard while Chun Yuqiao listens from the shadows, Bu Xiaogu turns the tables on their hard-drive setup. Listen to the Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这八块硬盘根本没坏呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们不敢惹一部，就拿我一个小行政开涮吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚才看见林姐，你们两个跑得比谁都快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你们俩就是承认陷害我了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你要说我没脑子，你们可就错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在把这八块硬盘放回素材房，跟谁都不要提起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "提醒他上个月跳槽的那个女主持人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "上个月跳槽的那个女主持人，其实根本不想离开公司吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我手里还有好多消息，你们想听吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "看来星天真是卧虎藏龙啊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这八块硬盘根本没坏呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These eight hard drives are not broken at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们不敢惹一部，就拿我一个小行政开涮吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Too scared to provoke Unit One, so you set up a junior admin assistant like me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚才看见林姐，你们两个跑得比谁都快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When you saw Lin Jie earlier, the two of you ran off faster than anyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你们俩就是承认陷害我了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the two of you admit that you framed me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你要说我没脑子，你们可就错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you think I have no brains, you could not be more mistaken.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在把这八块硬盘放回素材房，跟谁都不要提起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Put these eight hard drives back in the archive room now and mention this to nobody.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "提醒他上个月跳槽的那个女主持人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Remind him about the female host who switched networks last month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "上个月跳槽的那个女主持人，其实根本不想离开公司吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That female host who left last month never actually wanted to leave the firm, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我手里还有好多消息，你们想听吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know plenty more stories too; would you care to hear them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "看来星天真是卧虎藏龙啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It seems Xingtian really is full of hidden talent.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
